Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.41,0:00:47.08,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Ocultos na minha mão esquerda
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.08,0:00:50.30,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Meus desejos permanecem não realizados
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.30,0:00:55.01,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,880)\blur7.5}Presos em um sonho sem fim
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.46,0:00:58.30,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Ocultas na minha mão direita
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.30,0:01:01.51,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Minhas memórias vazias continuam invisíveis a todos
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.51,0:01:07.23,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Sendo açoitadas por uma chuva sem fim
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.23,0:01:13.38,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,540)\blur7.5}Seja a força para proteger o que é precioso
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.61,0:01:17.88,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Ou a fraqueza de perder a fé nisso
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.88,0:01:20.55,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,280)\blur7.5}Aceitarei tudo isso
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.82,0:01:23.32,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,480)\blur7.5}E buscarei um novo amanhecer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.08,0:01:31.69,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,780)\blur7.5}Ao estender a mão, vejo a luz
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.69,0:01:36.94,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,780)\blur7.5}Mesmo em farrapos, você salva a minha vida
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.09,0:01:40.76,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur7.5}All the feelings poured into
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.76,0:01:43.26,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}The tip of the blade held aloft
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.26,0:01:50.71,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(290,1080)\blur7.5}Uma prece que transcende o tempo
